},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-737f-b08a-860396f14849","description":"Bulbo maxilar","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-76dc-bf89-7f9e8e19d31f","description":"Nervo \u00f3ptico","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-707d-9eb6-cdd16743937b","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que a horologia estuda?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A horologia abrange o projeto, a constru\u00e7\u00e3o e o estudo de rel\u00f3gios de parede e de pulso; um horologista tamb\u00e9m pode restaurar rel\u00f3gios hist\u00f3ricos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7d49-9eba-52a9cdb17cde","description":"fabrica\u00e7\u00e3o de rel\u00f3gios, medi\u00e7\u00e3o do tempo e cronometragem","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7e5b-a922-fcb8442f4835","description":"animais","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-74e3-952e-cbf34f247f26","description":"doen\u00e7as ven\u00e9reas","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7b1e-a4f1-8fc1fba09eec","description":"fins ou causas finais","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7598-94c0-2650f8f11f4a","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 o menor osso do corpo humano?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"O estribo \u00e9 um dos tr\u00eas ossos min\u00fasculos do ouvido m\u00e9dio, que transmitem as vibra\u00e7\u00f5es sonoras em dire\u00e7\u00e3o ao ouvido interno.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-71b9-ba0d-ea8a7ff7b363","description":"Estapedius","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7084-a3bc-074caa7138af","description":"F\u00eamur","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-792e-852f-a98014ce6e4a","description":"\u00damero","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7d62-a81f-5cfc821d167f","description":"T\u00edbia","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7ca7-bda5-375a1d370f2f","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual ave \u00e9 conhecida por consumir um ter\u00e7o do seu peso corporal em uma \u00fanica refei\u00e7