e desenvolvido a penicilina como um tratamento pr\u00e1tico.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7025-a734-f64f2428a77e","description":"Alexander Fleming","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7cff-8d9c-8f9cf872d50f","description":"Louis Pasteur","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7a0f-9b17-bf6fb41b8d76","description":"Frederick Sanger","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7971-8568-c58eb2516862","description":"John Dalton","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7ea1-b734-9f91caa55c08","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 outro termo para \u201cmastigar\u201d?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Mastigar divide os alimentos em peda\u00e7os menores e os mistura com a saliva; engolir leva os alimentos para a garganta, enquanto a digest\u00e3o \u00e9 o processo mais amplo de decompor os alimentos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-74e0-91eb-110922ecd96a","description":"Mastiga\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7038-9501-5eab3b6cbd9b","description":"Engolir","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7bf3-abe9-8301bf29944d","description":"Digest\u00e3o","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-70f0-93fe-7036b782f375","description":"Saliva\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-78b1-acf7-9698c24bf5d7","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como voc\u00ea chamaria uma elefanta?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Uma \u201ccow\u201d \u00e9 uma elefanta adulta; os machos s\u00e3o chamados de \u201cbulls\u201d, e os filhotes de elefante s\u00e3o chamados de \u201ccalves\u201d.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7bfa-9c6e-9553b581b031","description":"Uma vaca","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7db2-8aa6-8f7961b84ddc","description":"Uma porca","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-71fb-a85d-9fd687465341","description":"Uma cor\u00e7a","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-768c-a569-847cbe1f3742","description":"Um curral","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7c54-a90c-f7485e9cc9f2","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual ordem de insetos \u00e9 chamada de Lepidoptera?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"As borboletas e as mariposas comp\u00f5em a ordem Lepidoptera, nome derivado de palavras gregas que significam \u201cescama\u201d e \u201casa\u201d, em refer\u00eancia \u00e0s escamas presentes em suas asas.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7014-befc-27de68af6570","description":"Borboletas e mariposas","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-754c-a416-fe0ebf5d205e","description":"Besouros","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7f26-8486-512a83d09a17","description":"Lib\u00e9lulas","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-75b1-88b7-eb84fe2c4e00","description":"Abelhas e vespas","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7726-91e4-9232900da65d","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 o m\u00ednimo m\u00faltiplo comum de 22 e 44?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"44 \u00e9 divis\u00edvel por 22, portanto j\u00e1 \u00e9 um m\u00faltiplo de ambos os n\u00fameros; nenhum n\u00famero positivo menor pode ser um m\u00faltiplo comum.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7042-8d4d-e7bac7f6b2e3","description":"44","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-777f-89e3-bc7205858abc","description":"22","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-72c6-ae51-f594f548df1a","description":"66","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7504-bcaf-758c1cdf6fa6","description":"88","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7d2c-be7e-9f130886454e","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Na astronomia, qual \u00e9 o termo usado para medir o brilho das estrelas?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A magnitude aparente mede o brilho de uma estrela visto da Terra; ao contr\u00e1rio da magnitude absoluta, ela depende tanto da luminosidade intr\u00ednseca da estrela quanto de sua dist\u00e2ncia.