 valores diferentes da raiz quadrada de 144?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Os dois valores s\u00e3o 12 e -12. O s\u00edmbolo \u221a144 denota apenas a raiz principal positiva, mas a resolu\u00e7\u00e3o da equa\u00e7\u00e3o x\u00b2 = 144 fornece ambos os valores.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7338-a6cb-c042169ca046","description":"12 e -12","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7c8e-beff-3ea8fb0b6c95","description":"144 e -144","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7b74-a7db-6fb9558a94d2","description":"24 e -24","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7d7a-b788-96c2568ea6da","description":"12 e 24","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-79af-8a3d-7385a1b2b9a0","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que a angiologia estuda?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A angiologia abrange as redes sangu\u00ednea e linf\u00e1tica do corpo, e n\u00e3o apenas o cora\u00e7\u00e3o.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7727-a195-b74bde82e95a","description":"Sistemas vasculares","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7e31-abdc-1e1287301586","description":"Quebra-cabe\u00e7as","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7289-a2c8-dd49e4de4e03","description":"Movimentos ondulat\u00f3rios","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7854-bfe1-0a1f418f4ecf","description":"Os registros dos an\u00e9is das \u00e1rvores","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7ba5-9e83-e335e956a561","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quem desenvolveu a vacina contra a var\u00edola?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Edward Jenner utilizou a var\u00edola bovina para proteger as pessoas contra a var\u00edola, sendo pioneiro na vacina\u00e7\u00e3o; a palavra deriva do latim \u201cvacca\u201d, que significa vaca.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7b52-ae53-6851e3c9c88b","description":"Edward Jenner","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7396-a784-7c67525a56f7","description":"Francis Crick","correct_answer":fa