 fur\u00e3o?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Um \u201ckit\u201d \u00e9 um filhote de fur\u00e3o. Os filhotes rec\u00e9m-nascidos v\u00eam ao mundo com os olhos e as orelhas fechados.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7e38-8554-dac25bb14045","description":"Um filhote","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-77f5-b721-42268f57ad54","description":"Um filhote de canguru","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7c70-bc18-d85003c3f9b8","description":"Uma \u00e1guia filhote","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-71d1-8109-fa3cbd749584","description":"Uma lava","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-78d7-a663-e3c179606ee2","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Para que serve o hipoclorito de s\u00f3dio, subst\u00e2ncia qu\u00edmica frequentemente utilizada?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"O hipoclorito de s\u00f3dio \u00e9 o princ\u00edpio ativo da \u00e1gua sanit\u00e1ria dom\u00e9stica; sua a\u00e7\u00e3o oxidante ajuda a decompor compostos coloridos e a eliminar micr\u00f3bios.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7edb-bbcf-28e4f28fe7c6","description":"\u00c9 utilizado para a limpeza de superf\u00edcies, clareamento, remo\u00e7\u00e3o de odores e desinfec\u00e7\u00e3o da \u00e1gua.","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7383-ac8e-b9dc74d983a0","description":"\u00c9 utilizado como ingrediente na produ\u00e7\u00e3o de vidro, tijolos e cer\u00e2mica.","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7249-abaf-d016ee94bf89","description":"\u00c9 utilizado na fabrica\u00e7\u00e3o de placas de gesso.","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7c36-b900-001d94f2a477","description":"\u00c9 utilizado para aliviar dores e inflama\u00e7\u00f5es.","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3d-7ddf-9fa7-7e9953e3e0c8","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que causa a tens\u00e3o superficial da \u00e1gua?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A coes\u00e3o intermolecular exerce uma for\u00e7a l\u00edquida volta