eancia da Terra.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-734e-8443-6ab0fc494221","description":"Erat\u00f3stenes","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7d31-8251-f500cac16f98","description":"Euclides","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7bbc-ad4f-5f57d8686d8f","description":"Ptolomeu","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-76fd-acc2-753d19c180ea","description":"Hiparco","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7540-a58a-e6ee1681a97d","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual f\u00edsico americano construiu o primeiro laser funcional em 1960, utilizando um cristal de rubi?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"O laser de rubi de Theodore Maiman utilizava uma l\u00e2mpada de flash para excitar o cristal, produzindo breves pulsos de luz vermelha.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7814-9ab6-ac62e782424c","description":"Theodore Maiman","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7947-b078-ff145e3c87d9","description":"Charles Townes","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7d44-897f-7aad872a3408","description":"Gordon Gould","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-710a-9d83-2109273d9bc1","description":"Arthur Schawlow","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-72be-ae14-207c2de873ac","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Onde podemos encontrar a membrana timp\u00e2nica?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A membrana timp\u00e2nica vibra em resposta ao som e transmite essas vibra\u00e7\u00f5es aos tr\u00eas ossinhos do ouvido m\u00e9dio.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7775-9600-5645b9f5d442","description":"Ouvido","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7036-a7c6-7fe1eb6034bd","description":"Nariz","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-734b-9daf-746282bcb968","description":"Boca","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7be9-875d-064818e8fde5","description":"Olho","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7548-bfa9-a019d5c16a29","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4