ription":"Atmosfera","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7f14-9135-2ddb4c30eb0e","description":"Hidrosfera","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7447-b117-f4fef6b01419","description":"Biosfera","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7b82-af08-9cdf4716290f","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que a semiologia estuda?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A semiologia estuda como os signos transmitem significado na comunica\u00e7\u00e3o e na cultura; o termo \u00e9 frequentemente usado de forma intercambi\u00e1vel com \u201csemi\u00f3tica\u201d.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-74df-b65a-3fd1d820c8e8","description":"sinais","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-79a1-854a-cc3350b19188","description":"trata-se de materiais terrestres que podem ser utilizados para fins econ\u00f4micos e\/ou industriais","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7da6-bd88-423f58344e79","description":"a pr\u00e1tica de escapar de restri\u00e7\u00f5es ou outras armadilhas","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7996-a43a-5e64da050bfb","description":"um ramo da l\u00f3gica que se concentra nas rela\u00e7\u00f5es entre partes e o todo","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7b3a-a857-59be085fad4d","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que a enologia estuda?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Enologia tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 escrita como oenologia; o termo deriva da palavra grega oinos, que significa vinho.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7598-be2e-815d0787d24e","description":"Vinho e vinifica\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7e13-a0b9-6884322dda65","description":"Baleias, golfinhos e botos","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-77f9-930f-184e77490482","description":"Coisas nojentas e repugnantes","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7982-8e63-05c108ec1a91","description":"Tibete","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-73c2-8931-81a3d3d254eb","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Na geometria, qual \u00e9 o oposto de um \u00e2ngulo agudo?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Um \u00e2ngulo obtuso mede mais de 90 graus, mas menos de 180 graus; um \u00e2ngulo agudo mede menos de 90 graus.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7c43-97b2-327319a01c98","description":"Obtuso","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-71dd-b2d6-4dc857bf8430","description":"Cr\u00f4nico","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7d93-bf7b-c4e117de7d95","description":"Vetor","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-704e-a017-715537fa2912","description":"Integral","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-79fa-972a-3a41ad379c08","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como voc\u00ea chamaria um filhote de lebre?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Um filhote de lebre nasce com pelos e os olhos abertos, ao contr\u00e1rio de um coelhinho rec\u00e9m-nascido, que geralmente \u00e9 cego e sem pelos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-71dc-bd7c-453f66760ec5","description":"Um filhote de lebre","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7f08-bae4-858cc37e6fd2","description":"Um filhote de ma\u00e7\u00e3","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7fb9-ae7a-642595ad6228","description":"Um filhote de veado","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7d9e-9a8d-b85dc9bdf2a4","description":"Uma larva","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7ba7-821d-7c43a7b3df26","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como voc\u00ea chamaria uma abelha macho?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Um zang\u00e3o \u00e9 uma abelha macho. Ao contr\u00e1rio das abelhas oper\u00e1rias, os zang\u00f5es n\u00e3o coletam p\u00f3len nem possuem ferr\u00f5es.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7c30-b057-de1061e9950a","description":"Um zang\u00e3o","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7b7f-a9b5-bcf4194dd138","description":"Um veado macho","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7642-9