6-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual osso N\u00c3O faz parte do cr\u00e2nio humano?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Os ossos do carpo formam o punho; os ossos occipital e temporal fazem parte do cr\u00e2nio, enquanto a maxila forma a mand\u00edbula superior.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7ced-b76e-9c9404e70a91","description":"Carpal","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7c87-bdfc-ba4317fd8d5c","description":"Occipital","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-75c3-9ae9-5d4ba9493d54","description":"Temporal","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7af6-85fd-57e80f23071c","description":"Maxila","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7edf-833b-37f0ac884cbd","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual elemento est\u00e1 faltando na alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o quando ocorre o b\u00f3cio?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"O iodo \u00e9 necess\u00e1rio para a produ\u00e7\u00e3o dos horm\u00f4nios da tireoide; uma defici\u00eancia pode causar o aumento do volume da gl\u00e2ndula tireoide, formando um b\u00f3cio.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-739c-bcf7-cc8bae5ca202","description":"Iodo","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7345-94e2-8c15e7275c74","description":"Pot\u00e1ssio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-730c-9db7-667241568eb0","description":"Cloro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-72d6-a8f8-16141dacf1bd","description":"Ferro","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7dc8-8217-84eadb45bfc5","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual prote\u00edna \u00e9 respons\u00e1vel pelo transporte de oxig\u00eanio no sangue?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A hemoglobina cont\u00e9m grupos heme que cont\u00eam ferro e se ligam ao oxig\u00eanio de forma revers\u00edvel, conferindo aos gl\u00f3bulos vermelhos sua cor.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7bfc-9ba8-19d92b61060d","description":"Hemoglobina","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7e2a-85b6-370372a1ee8a","description":"Histona","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7f88-bcb9-46dfde473859","description":"Histidina","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7167-bdbb-c91671b3f018","description":"GABA","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-765f-927a-0b7bda8eae7d","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a palavra para designar um grupo de patos-reais?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"\u201cSord\u201d \u00e9 um substantivo coletivo tradicional para patos-reais. Os patos-reais tamb\u00e9m s\u00e3o os ancestrais selvagens da maioria das ra\u00e7as de patos dom\u00e9sticos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7f85-b56b-2b7f0cd8c76e","description":"Um \u201csord\u201d","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-744b-981b-550ff5ec77e7","description":"Um \u201cparlamento\u201d","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7c3e-bf46-e6414ad69c5d","description":"Um \u201cpaddling\u201d","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-76a0-ad30-d55263cef7dd","description":"Um \u201cskulk\u201d","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7d3b-bc62-03a75682724f","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que estuda a ortopterologia?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A ortopterologia trata dos insetos da ordem Orthoptera; o nome tem origem em ra\u00edzes gregas que significam \u201casa reta\u201d, em refer\u00eancia \u00e0s suas asas anteriores.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7b9e-8cd3-1e7cf8ebd0cb","description":"gafanhotos e grilos","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7e17-bb8d-c4921720dded","description":"o estudo e o tratamento de doen\u00e7as do trato urogenital","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-796a-a193-b4a634934628","description":"a biosfera e suas rela\u00e7\u00f5es com a litosfera e a atmosfera","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7f41-af73-0bc3414fcdfa","description":"sa\u00fade e doen\u00e7as masculinas","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7cc7-bdb9-f1f13d4b24f7","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que estuda a actinologia?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"O termo deriva do grego \u201caktis\u201d, que significa \u201craio\u201d, e est\u00e1 associado \u00e0 fotoqu\u00edmica, o estudo das rea\u00e7\u00f5es qu\u00edmicas induzidas pela luz.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7fde-904c-4881a77acc68","description":"O efeito da luz sobre subst\u00e2ncias qu\u00edmicas","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-782d-ae76-6efa8486a1c9","description":"Comportamento animal","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-728e-846b-75e07bc7de0b","description":"Carrapatos e \u00e1caros","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-70bd-a5bb-8f5d33988ff5","description":"Ambientes de \u00e1gua doce","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-78d5-bd93-1cac51f68483","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como se chama o falc\u00e3o macho?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A palavra \u201cTiercel\u201d deriva de um termo que significa \u201cterceiro\u201d, o que tradicionalmente se explica pelo fato de o macho ser cerca de um ter\u00e7o menor que a f\u00eamea.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7b70-9ae2-fa6344e3cd87","description":"Um tiercel","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7cbd-bc55-887564859e2a","description":"Um jack","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7bc7-983c-46656c4fe6f7","description":"Um \u201cCob\u201d","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7ec1-9a19-4e10706c74e5","description":"Um \u201cBoar\u201d","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-73b2-b0bc-7509441ed86d","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual m\u00e9dico alem\u00e3o identificou a bact\u00e9ria causadora da tuberculose em 1882?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Os postulados de Koch estabelecem crit\u00e9rios para demonstrar que um microrganismo espec\u00edfico causa uma determinada doen\u00e7a.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af3e-7687-8596-030c6c5